# The system gitconfig has core.autocrlf=true. Without this file every clone
# and every checkout would rewrite these files with CRLF - including
# AmiDrop.guide, which amigaguide.datatype expects with LF, and the sources,
# which are cross-compiled for AmigaOS where CRLF is not the convention.
# Same approach as the LiveUpdate and mpega.library repositories.
* -text
